Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:42:55 +0200
Subject: glm: TF_GLM_PF_EXPERTS_ONCE, prompt gate/up rotate member rows in
 tf_exl3_prompt_gu_once (no per-route copies)

Default off. tf_exl3_prompt_gu_once: one block a matrix (gate, up) of a plan item, all 512 columns; each member
row's 128-wide k block rotated in shared memory with rot_in's arithmetic (FMUL, fwht128 as fwht128f, FMUL, fp16),
raw rows and suh by cp.async ahead, each warp streaming its own weight tiles; fp32 sums to the xg region, the item's
second block runs tgateup_n's epilogue. xd byte-identical to rot_in + tf_exl3_prompt_gu; old kernels' SASS unchanged.
tf-cuda-test exl3-prompt-once.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
